WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:27.320
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.960 --> 01:37.280
You spent so much money,

01:37.360 --> 01:40.960
-but only brought me these?
-Yan Zijing colludes

01:41.040 --> 01:42.240
with the head of Guangzhou's guild,
Pan Xinglu,

01:42.320 --> 01:45.600
and buys Guangzhou's stock of pearls
in bulk with treasure jewelry.

01:46.840 --> 01:51.080
Yan Zijing appears to backstab us
and force Cui's Pearl Farm to die.

01:51.160 --> 01:52.320
Cui's Pearl Farm can be considered

01:52.400 --> 01:54.640
one of the top merchants
in the jewelry industry,

01:54.720 --> 01:56.640
so how can we be under the control
of a nobody from Western Regions?

01:56.720 --> 01:58.600
Did my brother write back
after I asked you to write to him?

01:59.520 --> 02:00.640
Not yet.

02:08.800 --> 02:11.280
So what if he's powerful now?

02:12.280 --> 02:15.160
Relationships in this place
are deeply intertwined,

02:15.240 --> 02:16.400
and everyone has his or her own path.

02:16.480 --> 02:18.640
Cui's Pearl Farm has been here for years,

02:18.720 --> 02:20.960
so he should know something about it.

02:21.720 --> 02:23.640
Let's go meet Yan Zijing.

02:24.480 --> 02:25.320
Yes.

02:32.400 --> 02:34.760
Lady Shijiu is no worse than a man.

02:34.840 --> 02:37.200
As a woman, you show up

02:37.720 --> 02:40.040
and dedicate yourself
to the family business.

02:40.600 --> 02:41.560
I admire that.

02:41.640 --> 02:44.240
Men and women are both born
and raised by their parents,

02:44.320 --> 02:45.680
so what's the difference?

02:46.440 --> 02:50.360
Master Yan is a business wizard.
How can you be so biased?

02:55.080 --> 02:56.320
I'm sorry if I'm being rude.

02:57.600 --> 03:00.240
Do you realize you're about
to be in big trouble?

03:07.720 --> 03:11.920
I'm just a law-abiding businessman,
so why would I be in trouble?

03:12.000 --> 03:16.280
You bought the pearls at a low price,
but you don't know

03:16.360 --> 03:18.520
that the pearls are needed
by Special Envoy Xu,

03:18.600 --> 03:22.120
who is highly respected by Prince Tan.

03:23.040 --> 03:24.360
If you have offended him,

03:24.440 --> 03:26.480
how can you continue to trade here?

03:26.560 --> 03:30.000
So, in your opinion,
how can I make amends?

03:35.200 --> 03:39.040
If you can offer the pearls
to Special Envoy Xu

03:39.560 --> 03:42.480
and we persuade him in your favor,

03:42.560 --> 03:45.320
then the problem can be solved,

03:45.920 --> 03:48.480
and Special Envoy Xu
will surely promote you.

03:48.560 --> 03:49.720
Offer it to him?

04:01.720 --> 04:05.760
I thought you came here today
to talk business with me.

04:07.920 --> 04:09.520
Business is a transaction.

04:10.040 --> 04:12.040
Offering him pearls
is an expression of your loyalty,

04:12.120 --> 04:14.360
so it's more important than business.

04:14.880 --> 04:17.480
If you have contacts in officialdom,

04:18.000 --> 04:19.399
you won't fear any business difficulties.

04:19.480 --> 04:21.560
The official world might be
better suited to the Cui family.

04:21.640 --> 04:24.960
I am a stupid businessman

04:25.720 --> 04:26.680
who is profit-oriented.

04:26.760 --> 04:29.120
You're so smart

04:29.680 --> 04:32.040
that you predicted
we'd get involved in officialdom.

04:32.120 --> 04:33.760
In that case, name your price.

04:36.200 --> 04:39.400
I like that. Kang Ju.

04:46.120 --> 04:49.240
I have many pearls,

04:49.320 --> 04:52.240
but I don't dare sell them.

04:52.320 --> 04:55.200
A Qizhen pearl is worth two million mace.

04:55.280 --> 04:57.000
If it's a tael pearl plus a Babao pearl,

04:57.080 --> 04:59.040
it's worth 2.2 million mace.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.160
Are you having a price hike

05:00.240 --> 05:01.760
because you think Master Shijiu
doesn't know the market?

05:01.840 --> 05:03.840
The price of jewelry
depends on the market,

05:04.360 --> 05:05.840
so why is this a price hike?

05:05.920 --> 05:07.440
You're just being quibbling.

05:07.520 --> 05:08.880
-You think we--
-Tong.

05:08.960 --> 05:10.600
Don't lose your manners.

05:10.680 --> 05:12.000
Lady Shijiu.

05:12.080 --> 05:14.160
Since you are no worse than any male,

05:14.240 --> 05:16.440
I need not be too polite to you.

05:16.520 --> 05:18.000
If you can't make the decision,

05:18.080 --> 05:20.000
then ask the head
of the Cui family to step in

05:20.080 --> 05:24.240
so as not to break the rules
or influence the market.

05:24.840 --> 05:27.480
Since I'm sitting here,

05:27.560 --> 05:29.280
I can make a decision for the Cui family.

05:30.360 --> 05:32.600
You hoard commodities so much,

05:32.680 --> 05:34.560
so aren't you afraid
of losing everything then?

05:34.640 --> 05:36.680
I won't bother you with that.

05:40.560 --> 05:42.160
This price

05:43.920 --> 05:44.840
is very good.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.360
Of course.

05:52.960 --> 05:54.440
-Look at that.
-What's that?

05:55.040 --> 05:57.240
-What's that?
-That's the fabric store.

05:57.320 --> 05:58.760
There, the fabric store.

05:59.320 --> 06:01.120
Move!

06:02.000 --> 06:03.120
It's beautiful.

06:03.200 --> 06:04.720
Look at that.

06:07.200 --> 06:08.320
It's awesome.

06:08.400 --> 06:09.720
There's a fire show over there.

06:14.480 --> 06:17.000
-You can try it.
-Sir, I'll take these.

06:17.080 --> 06:18.680
Come on. You can try some.

06:18.760 --> 06:20.000
-Give me a few more.
-Which one do you want?

06:20.080 --> 06:20.920
-This one.
-Okay.

06:21.000 --> 06:21.960
Give me one of these, please.

06:22.040 --> 06:23.080
-And this one.
-This? No problem.

06:23.160 --> 06:24.520
Duanwu, give me one.

06:24.600 --> 06:25.960
It's so good.

06:26.040 --> 06:28.160
-It's delicious.
-Please come and take a look.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.240
-Come. Look at the hairpin.
-Look.

06:29.320 --> 06:30.760
-This is a nice hairpin.
-There's also rouge here.

06:31.280 --> 06:32.480
If you like it, you can try it on.

06:32.560 --> 06:34.280
This one is beautiful.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.520
-I'll try it on for you.
-There's a bronze mirror.

06:36.360 --> 06:37.280
It's beautiful.

06:37.360 --> 06:39.000
-I'll try this on for you.
-Come on.

06:40.840 --> 06:42.240
-It's nice.
-It's nice.

06:42.320 --> 06:43.200
-How much is it?
-It's nice.

06:43.280 --> 06:46.600
It's made of pure coral. Fifty cash.

06:47.520 --> 06:48.360
How much is it?

06:48.440 --> 06:49.880
-Fifty cash?
-Fifty cash.

06:49.960 --> 06:52.440
Wait a minute.
It's obviously coral trimmings,

06:52.520 --> 06:55.680
-so how can it cost so much?
-Stop. Are you buying?

06:55.760 --> 06:57.480
Yeah, sure.

07:01.120 --> 07:03.120
Let's go somewhere else.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.680
-Duanwu. Let's go somewhere else.
-Let's go.

07:07.080 --> 07:08.360
-Go that way.
-Let's go.

07:08.440 --> 07:10.840
-Let's go.
-Shrimp.

07:11.800 --> 07:12.680
OK.

07:12.760 --> 07:15.200
Special Envoy Xu is really not here.

07:15.280 --> 07:17.520
-Master Shijiu, please return.
-Master Shijiu.

07:17.600 --> 07:20.880
-This…
-Special Envoy Xu's place is so noble

07:20.960 --> 07:23.200
that even Cui's Pearl Farm
doesn't deserve to be here.

07:24.040 --> 07:26.480
Xu Lin. You can tell lies

07:26.560 --> 07:30.280
or put on airs elsewhere,

07:30.800 --> 07:36.080
but why do you dare
to stop Master Shijiu even here?

07:36.160 --> 07:37.880
Ask Master Shijiu to take his seat.

07:37.960 --> 07:39.240
Aye.

07:40.480 --> 07:44.320
I was uninformed, so I apologize to you.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.080
Please be seated.

07:47.920 --> 07:50.680
I came here today because I had a chance

07:50.760 --> 07:52.840
to try this pastry
and thought it was good.

07:53.360 --> 07:55.720
Then I brought it here for you to try it.

08:02.360 --> 08:06.480
I am new to Guangzhou,
so I rely on your help.

08:07.120 --> 08:09.680
After all, I don't know what I should do

08:09.760 --> 08:12.600
if something happens to the Cui family
and involves you.

08:12.680 --> 08:15.080
Master Shijiu, you are overstating it.

08:15.760 --> 08:20.400
You also know that I have
always favored the Cui family,

08:20.480 --> 08:24.840
but lately, Zhang Jinran
has been keeping an eye on me.

08:24.920 --> 08:27.360
If I insist

08:27.440 --> 08:29.600
on favoring you for a while,

08:29.680 --> 08:33.760
I may be criticized and hindered.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.400
Regarding Zhang Jinran, I'll do something.

08:35.480 --> 08:39.320
I like dealing with smart people.
You're just in time.

08:39.400 --> 08:42.960
In a few days, come with me
to meet the head of Guangzhou's guild.

08:44.480 --> 08:47.280
Yes, sir. Thank you, Special Envoy Xu.

08:47.360 --> 08:49.400
-See you later.
-Hey.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.880
I suddenly remembered something

08:52.960 --> 08:55.840
and would like your help.

08:55.920 --> 08:58.720
Please let me know if you need anything.

09:02.080 --> 09:03.400
I recently

09:03.960 --> 09:06.840
acquired a white jade Guanyin

09:06.920 --> 09:09.640
and would like to dedicate it
to Prince Tan as a birthday gift,

09:10.160 --> 09:11.000
but it lacks

09:11.080 --> 09:14.800
a pearl lotus flower base
to complement it.

09:14.880 --> 09:18.920
It's a pity that it's not as beautiful
as it should be.

09:21.800 --> 09:24.440
Special Envoy Xu. The immediate priority

09:24.520 --> 09:25.600
is to resolve the matter
of the tribute pearls.

09:25.680 --> 09:29.840
Aren't we working on your tribute pearls?

09:29.920 --> 09:33.200
Prince Tan's needs are no small matter,

09:33.280 --> 09:37.040
so the pearls must be
of the highest quality.

09:37.120 --> 09:38.320
Don't worry.

09:38.920 --> 09:42.200
I will pay for the pearls.

09:42.280 --> 09:46.360
Think of it as me buying them
from Cui's Pearl Farm.

09:48.840 --> 09:49.760
Of course.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.000
See you.

09:59.000 --> 10:01.320
Buy? When has he ever paid for anything?

10:02.360 --> 10:04.400
What a greedy vampire.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.400
But we have no choice.

10:09.920 --> 10:12.120
Now the tribute pearls are imminent,

10:12.200 --> 10:15.120
so I still need this treacherous guy
to maneuver through it for me.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.280
After this is over,

10:17.840 --> 10:19.440
we can't have any more dealings
with this man.

10:19.960 --> 10:20.800
Aye.

10:48.800 --> 10:52.800
Shrimp. Shrimp.

10:55.280 --> 10:59.080
Shrimp. Come on.

11:04.320 --> 11:06.200
Come on. Look.

11:08.120 --> 11:09.960
Does this look like a peach blossom?

11:10.040 --> 11:11.280
Yes, it does.

11:11.360 --> 11:14.240
Doesn't this look better than the one
we saw on the street?

11:15.120 --> 11:16.240
Look.

11:16.320 --> 11:18.320
If I add a little more tassel

11:18.400 --> 11:20.840
down this branch, do you think

11:21.360 --> 11:23.800
-this hairpin will look good?
-Yes.

11:23.880 --> 11:26.760
But Duanwu, why did you draw this?

11:27.920 --> 11:28.920
You mean this?

11:31.160 --> 11:32.280
I want to make hairpins.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.920
Since we have jewelry,

11:34.440 --> 11:37.800
we can just make a hairpin
out of this scrap jewelry.

11:37.880 --> 11:39.840
Some girls will love it.

11:43.160 --> 11:46.160
But now, we only have these jewels.

11:46.240 --> 11:49.440
What can we use for the main part?

11:54.920 --> 11:56.000
Wood?

11:57.120 --> 12:01.160
Wood will crack in water,
so wood definitely won't work.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.160
Duanwu, wait a minute.

12:18.760 --> 12:19.760
What's this?

12:20.600 --> 12:24.280
It's old ship wood.
Duanwu, don't underestimate it.

12:24.800 --> 12:28.200
old ship wood is top hardwood.

12:28.280 --> 12:31.880
Soaked in seawater,
it'll never get soaked or cracked.

12:31.960 --> 12:33.680
Then I'll try it with this.

12:36.320 --> 12:37.800
-Look.
-Duanwu.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.240
-Help me--
-Duanwu.

12:39.320 --> 12:40.920
Dear Hu, why are you still up?

12:41.440 --> 12:44.280
I heard that Overseer Cao received

12:44.360 --> 12:46.400
the Coral Pearl trafficking assignment
from Assistant Pang

12:46.480 --> 12:47.800
and was allowed
to enter the trading convoy

12:47.880 --> 12:48.880
after the job was done.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.920
Why would someone

12:53.000 --> 12:55.920
as shrewd as him
keep this greedy lapdog with him?

12:56.520 --> 12:58.120
Coral Pearl?

13:01.280 --> 13:02.480
Thank you.

13:03.000 --> 13:06.560
I think Coral Pearl
might be a good way for us.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.800
Hello, Accountant Wei.
Hello, Assistant Pang.

13:27.240 --> 13:29.840
Assistant Pang. Sorry to bother you.

13:31.720 --> 13:35.520
I heard Overseer Cao say
he's selling Coral Pearl for you.

13:36.400 --> 13:38.600
-Can I try?
-What?

13:39.120 --> 13:40.680
You want to sell Coral Pearl?

13:40.760 --> 13:45.560
It's Coral Pearl, not scrap.

13:45.640 --> 13:48.360
If you lose it,
you'll suffer more than a whipping.

13:48.440 --> 13:50.680
It would kill you.

13:50.760 --> 13:52.720
My life isn't worth much,

13:53.280 --> 13:55.400
so I hope you'll give it a chance
and let me try.

13:55.480 --> 13:58.080
Whether you care
about your own life or not,

13:58.160 --> 14:00.240
you have to know the product first.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.200
Have you seen

14:04.800 --> 14:06.000
Coral Pearl?

14:14.120 --> 14:17.000
Is Assistant Pang selling
this batch of Coral Pearls?

14:17.640 --> 14:20.880
It's dyed and inferior. It's worthless.

14:22.040 --> 14:25.720
Duanwu. Do you want to join
the trading convoy?

14:25.800 --> 14:26.920
Of course.

14:27.000 --> 14:29.720
It's not up to me.

14:36.040 --> 14:37.200
Not up to you?

14:38.600 --> 14:41.240
But Overseer Cao said it's your call

14:41.760 --> 14:43.200
to join the trading convoy.

14:44.440 --> 14:46.440
-When did I say that?
-Everyone on the lower deck knows that.

14:46.520 --> 14:49.000
Overseer Cao is a slave,
even though he's the head.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.680
If you don't keep your word,

14:50.760 --> 14:52.320
the slaves on the lower deck
will know about this,

14:52.840 --> 14:55.240
and the whole ship will be unsettled.

14:55.320 --> 14:57.520
-Duanwu, you know what--?
-Assistant Pang.

14:58.040 --> 14:59.640
A businessman

14:59.720 --> 15:03.120
must keep his word after saying something.

15:04.080 --> 15:06.920
Makes sense. How about this?

15:07.000 --> 15:10.120
Whoever gets the order first
joins the trading convoy.

15:13.240 --> 15:15.640
Thank you, Assistant Pang.
Thank you, Accountant Wei.

15:15.720 --> 15:20.480
Also, I'm going to bring out a box
of fine Coral Pearls.

15:20.560 --> 15:22.880
It costs 200,000 mace to buy,

15:22.960 --> 15:26.040
so its selling price should be
at least 500,000 mace.

15:33.920 --> 15:36.400
We know you love incense,

15:36.920 --> 15:39.760
so we have prepared a small gift for you.

15:40.480 --> 15:42.600
Please accept it.

15:48.920 --> 15:52.120
I've seen a lot of nice things

15:52.640 --> 15:56.120
along the way from Chang'an to Lingnan,

15:56.640 --> 16:01.640
but I can't get enough
of the Lingnan Pearl.

16:01.720 --> 16:04.080
I'm glad you like it.

16:04.160 --> 16:06.240
But recently, I heard that some people

16:06.320 --> 16:08.240
want to compare
Western Regions colored stone

16:08.320 --> 16:10.720
with Lingnan pearls.

16:11.680 --> 16:12.600
Is this true?

16:18.320 --> 16:20.760
The seniors
of several jewelry stores and I

16:20.840 --> 16:23.040
did recently purchase a batch
of Western Regions colored stone.

16:23.640 --> 16:27.600
After Hepu's accident,
the pearl market is slightly depressed.

16:27.680 --> 16:30.520
Colored stone is a rarity locally.

16:30.600 --> 16:33.120
-If--
-But even so,

16:33.200 --> 16:37.160
it's a minority item and not of grace.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.120
Mr. Pan.

16:41.000 --> 16:43.400
You've just become
the head of Guangzhou's guild,

16:43.480 --> 16:47.280
so it's best not to rush into things

16:47.360 --> 16:49.680
until you know what's going on,

16:50.280 --> 16:53.160
so you don't end up
making everyone unhappy

16:53.240 --> 16:56.240
or bringing shame to Lingnan Pearls.

16:57.360 --> 16:59.080
You're right.

16:59.800 --> 17:02.880
Lingnan pearls are rare,

17:03.400 --> 17:07.520
so I don't want them all
to fall into other people's hands.

17:09.960 --> 17:11.079
I understand.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.359
Do you all understand?

17:18.160 --> 17:19.720
Yes.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.359
That's good.

17:42.480 --> 17:44.440
ZHUOBAO HOUSE

17:45.160 --> 17:47.960
Nuts. Nice and big.

17:48.040 --> 17:51.040
Boy, come on. Taste it.

17:51.120 --> 17:53.640
Nice, big, and crunchy nuts. Taste it.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.000
You'll be satisfied.

17:56.280 --> 17:57.160
Taste it.

17:58.600 --> 18:00.760
-Is it good?
-Yes, it is.

18:01.840 --> 18:03.320
-I want it.
-OK.

18:04.080 --> 18:05.640
-How much is it?
-Ten cash.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.720
There you go.

18:07.240 --> 18:09.320
Sir. I'd like to ask you about this store.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.520
It looks very luxurious.

18:11.600 --> 18:12.920
This store is called Zhuobao House.

18:13.000 --> 18:17.200
It's the most luxurious
jewelry store in Guangzhou.

18:19.600 --> 18:22.200
So, Overseer Cao is going
to sell Coral Pearl here.

18:22.280 --> 18:25.240
The most famous person
in this store is actually

18:25.320 --> 18:27.640
the owner's daughter. Lady Wu.

18:28.840 --> 18:32.760
-Why?
-The price of this will be different.

18:36.000 --> 18:38.480
-I'll take another pack.
-Okay.

18:38.560 --> 18:39.680
Here you go.

18:46.080 --> 18:47.400
Lady Wu

18:48.080 --> 18:50.000
had two marriages,

18:50.640 --> 18:53.360
but one fiancé fell off a horse and died,

18:53.440 --> 18:55.600
and the other died of a disease.

18:56.840 --> 19:00.520
A fortune teller said
she was a plague on her husband.

19:00.600 --> 19:02.920
If I'm really ill-fated,

19:03.960 --> 19:05.840
I might as well be a female Taoist priest.

19:05.920 --> 19:08.800
She has been praying
to the gods for several years

19:09.800 --> 19:11.240
and is very depressed.

19:43.920 --> 19:45.520
Thank you, South Sea God.

19:46.520 --> 19:48.120
Thank you, South Sea God.

19:49.080 --> 19:51.320
I've come to return the favor.

19:52.040 --> 19:53.480
Thank you, South Sea God, for blessing me

19:53.560 --> 19:55.120
and giving me Blessing Red Coral

19:55.640 --> 19:58.520
that let me have a good man
and a good marriage.

19:59.040 --> 20:00.240
Thank you, South Sea God.

20:02.520 --> 20:03.960
Thank you, South Sea God.

20:04.880 --> 20:06.000
Hello.

20:07.200 --> 20:08.760
What is Blessing Red Coral?

20:09.840 --> 20:10.720
Miss.

20:11.360 --> 20:14.360
I come from a bad background
and have a bad fate,

20:15.120 --> 20:16.760
so I pray to the South Sea God every day.

20:17.400 --> 20:20.560
Perhaps because South Sea God
was moved by my devotion,

20:21.080 --> 20:23.200
I found such a fine Coral Pearl.

20:23.280 --> 20:25.760
I brought the Coral Pearl with me
to worship every day,

20:26.280 --> 20:28.240
but I didn't expect that my luck
would really turn around.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.920
Thank you, South Sea God.

20:30.000 --> 20:33.400
Can I see

20:33.920 --> 20:35.200
your Blessing Red Coral?

20:35.800 --> 20:36.960
Of course.

20:39.440 --> 20:42.120
-Please.
-Thank you very much.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.840
Miss, where did you

20:51.400 --> 20:53.880
buy this Blessing Red Coral?

20:55.320 --> 20:58.480
I didn't buy it. I polished it myself.

20:58.560 --> 21:02.560
To show my sincerity,
I made the Coral Pearl

21:02.640 --> 21:03.960
and the pin myself.

21:04.680 --> 21:08.040
Miss. You're very kind.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.280
Can you give me

21:09.800 --> 21:12.320
this Coral Pearl hairpin?

21:14.120 --> 21:15.320
I'm just like you.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.200
The fortune teller said
I'm a plague to my husband.

21:17.920 --> 21:21.600
We're both in the same boat.
Can you help me?

21:23.320 --> 21:25.920
I'm the daughter of the proprietor
of Zhuobao House, Lady Wu.

21:26.520 --> 21:28.200
I will never treat you badly.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.080
Nice to meet you, Lady Wu.

21:41.880 --> 21:43.080
I'm Duanwu.

21:45.520 --> 21:47.560
I'm sorry I can't give this to you.

21:48.480 --> 21:51.400
I'm just holding it for peace of mind.

21:53.320 --> 21:57.120
-I'm sorry if I'm being abrupt.
-I have a box of Coral Pearl.

21:57.200 --> 21:59.240
If you would like…

21:59.320 --> 22:01.240
May I purchase it from you?

22:02.040 --> 22:03.560
Sea God.

22:04.080 --> 22:08.080
Someone's full of nonsense,
so what do we do?

22:10.840 --> 22:13.000
-Do you know this man?
-No, I don't.

22:13.560 --> 22:15.120
Sea God.

22:15.920 --> 22:18.920
Someone's full of lies, so what do we do?

22:19.000 --> 22:20.560
Lady Wu.

22:21.720 --> 22:22.960
Come with me.

22:24.360 --> 22:26.520
Duanwu. Why are you here?

22:27.920 --> 22:29.280
Do you really know each other?

22:29.360 --> 22:31.960
-No.
-Yes.

22:32.040 --> 22:34.160
We met in Hepu. We're old friends.

22:34.920 --> 22:37.320
Lady Wu. At first…

22:38.000 --> 22:39.640
How dare you lie to me?

22:41.680 --> 22:42.520
Wait a minute. Lady Wu.

22:42.600 --> 22:43.720
-Duanwu.
-I…

22:48.240 --> 22:49.760
What's wrong with you lately?

22:51.120 --> 22:53.120
It's how I survive.

22:55.520 --> 22:56.720
I've always been like this.

22:58.080 --> 22:59.400
But no matter what,

23:00.280 --> 23:01.720
it's wrong to lie to people.

23:02.640 --> 23:03.720
Mr. Zhang, I'm sorry.

23:06.840 --> 23:08.440
I lied to you at the poetry gathering.

23:08.960 --> 23:11.400
I saw Cui Ding on the boat,

23:14.320 --> 23:17.200
but Cui Ding was killed by himself,
not Yan Zijing.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.320
Cui's Pearl Farm

23:19.400 --> 23:22.080
uses ordinary people as slaves
and sets up their own torture chambers.

23:22.160 --> 23:25.760
The lives of slaves are nothing,
and no one cares about them.

23:25.840 --> 23:29.800
Mr. Zhang, I'll be honest with you.
Even if this isn't Yan Zijing,

23:31.160 --> 23:32.560
I won't let him go.

23:32.640 --> 23:34.640
What good is the law

23:34.720 --> 23:36.880
if everyone thinks like you?

23:46.720 --> 23:49.560
I see the world differently from you.

23:50.160 --> 23:52.840
It's like you think a fish
jumping out of the water

23:52.920 --> 23:54.200
is a beautiful sight,

23:54.280 --> 23:57.080
but they fight to the death underwater.

24:02.720 --> 24:03.560
I'm sorry, Duanwu.

24:06.120 --> 24:07.840
You're living a life

24:08.440 --> 24:10.400
I've never experienced before,

24:11.720 --> 24:13.000
so I can't empathize.

24:14.160 --> 24:17.920
Today, I'm overthinking,
but I sincerely hope

24:18.000 --> 24:19.720
you don't do anything against your will

24:20.720 --> 24:22.360
for anyone or anything.

24:23.040 --> 24:24.000
I know.

24:28.080 --> 24:32.040
Today, I didn't do the right thing,

24:33.240 --> 24:37.080
but I can't help it.
Mr. Zhang, I can't help it.

24:37.800 --> 24:42.320
I wanted to sell Coral Pearl
to Zhuobao House, but I'm new here,

24:43.160 --> 24:47.160
so why would they do business with me
or trust me?

24:47.920 --> 24:49.600
Noble people will do what is right.

24:50.480 --> 24:54.040
A businessman will say nice things
in order to make a profit.

24:54.120 --> 24:55.240
Yan Zijing

24:55.760 --> 24:58.440
spent ten taels of pearls
to start a pearl poetry gathering.

24:58.960 --> 25:02.680
It's the same thing
as your promotion of Blessing Red Coral,

25:03.400 --> 25:05.240
but you can only fool some people
for a while

25:05.760 --> 25:07.600
if you use blessing as a gimmick.

25:08.400 --> 25:12.160
If Lady Wu doesn't get lucky later
and gets angry,

25:13.520 --> 25:15.280
will she hold it against you?

25:17.280 --> 25:18.840
Yan Zijing's business

25:20.520 --> 25:22.880
is a deadly fight.

25:23.840 --> 25:25.240
It's too aggressive,

25:27.640 --> 25:28.680
but Duanwu, you're different.

25:29.640 --> 25:31.480
You have to keep your heart true.

25:32.040 --> 25:34.560
A utilitarian approach won't last long.

25:35.200 --> 25:38.240
If you are sincere with Lady Wu just now,

25:38.840 --> 25:41.080
maybe she'll give you more business

25:41.600 --> 25:44.440
and become friends with you later.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.000
She won't.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.160
How can someone

25:57.800 --> 25:59.600
like me be her friend?

26:01.840 --> 26:02.880
You will.

26:04.480 --> 26:05.800
Today,

26:07.120 --> 26:10.600
you told me the truth about Cui Ding,

26:10.680 --> 26:12.480
so we are still friends.

26:21.080 --> 26:22.840
But how can I apologize to Lady Wu?

26:23.480 --> 26:24.680
I'm just like you.

26:24.760 --> 26:26.240
The fortune teller said
I'm a plague on my husband.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.720
That fortune teller…

26:30.040 --> 26:31.240
Is it really her destiny?

26:39.160 --> 26:41.200
-Come on.
-Thank you.

26:41.280 --> 26:43.040
-Come again. See you.
-Okay.

26:50.720 --> 26:53.080
Miss, what kind of clothes do you want?

26:56.000 --> 26:58.640
Ma'am, do you have any fine clothes?

26:59.240 --> 27:01.560
A new shipment just arrived today.

27:06.960 --> 27:08.240
Come on. Take a look.

27:08.320 --> 27:12.760
This is the most fashionable fabric
and the latest style.

27:12.840 --> 27:16.240
All the famous nobles here want it.
Do you like it?

27:16.760 --> 27:18.800
That fortune teller is only for the rich.

27:21.160 --> 27:23.320
Yes. Yes.

27:25.160 --> 27:26.200
Madam.

27:27.240 --> 27:28.400
Could you rent it to me for half a day?

27:29.680 --> 27:31.760
We sell all our clothes here.

27:34.840 --> 27:37.320
Miss. Are you going to see your lover?

27:37.400 --> 27:38.240
No.

27:39.040 --> 27:43.400
I want to make amends to a lady
by doing something for her.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.840
Okay, then.

27:45.920 --> 27:49.080
Since you want to make amends,
I'll do what you want this time,

27:49.760 --> 27:52.000
but please keep it safe.

27:55.680 --> 28:00.760
Let me wrap it up for you. Here you go.

28:32.040 --> 28:32.880
Lady Wu.

28:35.600 --> 28:38.240
-I'm Duanwu. I'm…
-What?

28:38.880 --> 28:40.280
How dare you even come to my house?

28:40.920 --> 28:42.160
It's not what you think.

28:43.000 --> 28:45.280
I've come to apologize to you.

28:46.440 --> 28:48.520
I did have the wrong idea today

28:48.600 --> 28:51.120
and wanted to approach you
with the red coral.

28:51.640 --> 28:53.200
I'm one of Yan's Trading Convoy,

28:53.280 --> 28:56.520
so I have Coral Pearl
and want to sell it to Zhuobao House.

28:57.240 --> 29:00.200
That's why I did such a stupid thing
and made you sad.

29:01.480 --> 29:02.800
I'm very sorry.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.720
You're honest,

29:06.720 --> 29:10.200
but my father is in charge of business,
not me.

29:10.280 --> 29:11.120
You're talking to the wrong person.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.280
It's not about business.

29:16.400 --> 29:20.080
It's not about business or red coral.

29:22.360 --> 29:23.760
It's about you.

29:25.560 --> 29:26.520
I want to help you.

29:32.120 --> 29:34.000
Do you think I'll ever trust you again?

29:35.000 --> 29:36.360
I was born with bad luck,

29:37.080 --> 29:38.520
so it's no wonder
you've come to lie to me too.

29:47.280 --> 29:48.280
I'm sorry.

29:50.120 --> 29:51.440
I'm really sorry.

29:54.840 --> 29:57.720
I know you're a little depressed,

30:02.160 --> 30:03.760
but I'd like to say

30:06.440 --> 30:08.040
that luck doesn't depend

30:09.680 --> 30:11.960
on things but on people.

30:15.320 --> 30:19.280
Please believe me for the last time.

31:03.960 --> 31:04.800
Master.

31:18.480 --> 31:19.600
Master.

31:20.120 --> 31:23.080
My friend is the ninth daughter
of the Pan family.

31:23.680 --> 31:26.520
I'm a distant cousin
of a jewelry shop in Guangzhou.

31:26.600 --> 31:28.800
I've heard that you're skillful
in reading fortunes,

31:28.880 --> 31:32.200
so I've come
to ask you to read my fortune.

31:45.240 --> 31:47.920
You are good-looking.

31:48.440 --> 31:50.760
I can tell you're from a rich family.

31:50.840 --> 31:52.640
But there's a curse

31:52.720 --> 31:54.360
on your forehead,

31:54.440 --> 31:57.840
so you're destined for a disaster.

32:01.400 --> 32:04.600
Master, what is it?

32:13.880 --> 32:17.040
Miss. The fairy said

32:17.120 --> 32:20.280
your husband died because of you.

32:32.360 --> 32:33.680
I knew

32:33.760 --> 32:36.040
I caused my husband's death.

32:36.120 --> 32:38.520
If I had known I would live

32:40.440 --> 32:41.480
such a lonely life,

32:43.160 --> 32:46.920
I should have died with you. Is that okay?

32:53.000 --> 32:54.480
Don't be too sad.

32:55.560 --> 32:58.480
-Your husband…
-My husband was most worried

32:59.280 --> 33:00.480
about me before he died.

33:01.320 --> 33:04.200
Now he has passed away,
but he is still worried about me.

33:04.280 --> 33:06.480
Today, knowing I've come
to ask for your help,

33:06.560 --> 33:07.960
he came with me.

33:08.040 --> 33:09.680
Came with you?

33:14.800 --> 33:16.120
My husband

33:17.480 --> 33:18.360
is right behind you.

33:21.520 --> 33:23.160
How dare you be so rude?

33:23.240 --> 33:26.480
I've never been married,
so how could I have a husband?

33:26.560 --> 33:27.960
Aren't you the ninth daughter
of the Pan family?

33:28.040 --> 33:30.320
Why do you know about
the ninth daughter of the Pan family?

33:30.840 --> 33:32.000
I'm just a slave.

33:32.080 --> 33:34.040
Knowing some news of famous families,

33:34.120 --> 33:35.480
you're swindling everywhere.

33:35.560 --> 33:37.080
And you told Lady Wu's fortune

33:37.160 --> 33:38.200
and said she was a plague on her husband.

33:38.280 --> 33:41.000
Of those two, one fell off a horse
and the other died of disease.

33:41.080 --> 33:42.680
What does that have to do with Lady Wu?

33:42.760 --> 33:45.120
Do you know how many rumors
she suffered because of you?

33:45.200 --> 33:46.240
Are you really telling fortunes?

33:46.320 --> 33:48.320
You're trying to kill people for money.

33:53.320 --> 33:56.480
Miss. My fortune-telling in the past
was pure nonsense.

33:56.560 --> 33:58.600
I was just making some money.

33:58.680 --> 34:00.840
Please spare me. Please spare me.

34:00.920 --> 34:03.160
Don't dirty my clothes. I'll give it back.

34:07.320 --> 34:08.360
Get her.

34:09.639 --> 34:11.920
Let go of me.

34:12.000 --> 34:13.440
Please spare me.

34:13.520 --> 34:16.000
You're a fraud and a disgrace to the gods.
Take her to the official.

34:16.080 --> 34:17.719
-Yes, Madam.
-Please forgive me.

34:17.800 --> 34:21.040
Please forgive me.
I won't dare to do it again.

34:21.120 --> 34:22.440
Lady Wu.

34:25.280 --> 34:27.159
You saw that just now.

34:27.800 --> 34:30.440
I wish you all the best in the future.

34:33.400 --> 34:34.480
Goodbye.

34:39.920 --> 34:41.080
Duanwu.

34:49.960 --> 34:52.040
How are your new clothes?

34:52.760 --> 34:54.400
Don't worry.

34:55.040 --> 34:57.800
It's not dirty. I can return it.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.720
Thank you.

35:04.680 --> 35:07.320
I'm not in a position
to accept your thanks.

35:08.480 --> 35:11.920
It's my fault in the first place.
I should apologize.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.440
I'm sorry to say that,

35:15.520 --> 35:18.160
but a woman shouldn't be bound
by her so-called destiny.

35:19.880 --> 35:22.520
Remember. Don't look back.

35:32.680 --> 35:34.480
Dark clouds can't hide the sun.

35:36.000 --> 35:38.920
From now on,
you don't have to wear a veil.

35:46.440 --> 35:48.800
Do you still want to sell Coral Pearl?

35:57.640 --> 35:58.720
Thanks, Dad.

36:00.560 --> 36:01.440
Duanwu.

36:06.520 --> 36:09.640
Thanks, Mr. Feng. Thanks, Lady Wu.

36:11.160 --> 36:14.720
This is my first order in my life.

36:15.360 --> 36:17.520
If this sells well,
I'll come back and order from you.

36:18.120 --> 36:20.680
-Okay,
-Duanwu.

36:21.880 --> 36:23.800
You can call me Wu from now on.

36:28.160 --> 36:29.760
-Wu.
-Yes.

36:29.840 --> 36:31.360
Mr. Feng, we…

36:34.480 --> 36:36.880
This is…

36:37.480 --> 36:39.280
-Don't break it.
-Duanwu.

36:40.080 --> 36:41.160
You…

36:45.880 --> 36:47.400
This is the slave on our ship.

36:47.480 --> 36:49.320
It's the same if she signs it or I do.

36:49.400 --> 36:50.440
-Same.
-It's not the same.

36:50.520 --> 36:53.080
Duanwu negotiated this order with me.

37:00.520 --> 37:01.520
Duanwu.

37:09.480 --> 37:11.680
Thirty percent of the profits

37:11.760 --> 37:14.760
from slave Duanwu's jewelry
and other items

37:14.840 --> 37:18.560
go to Yan's Trading Convoy.

37:20.880 --> 37:22.160
Is this true?

37:26.800 --> 37:29.280
A deposit from Zhuobao House.
We can deliver the goods tomorrow.

37:29.920 --> 37:33.560
-Do you still think this is false?
-It's great.

37:35.360 --> 37:38.960
I sold Coral Pearl,
so can I enter the trading convoy?

37:40.120 --> 37:43.360
-This requires Master's approval.
-Master's approval?

37:43.440 --> 37:45.400
We had a deal,

37:45.480 --> 37:47.560
and that's not what you told Overseer Cao.

37:47.640 --> 37:49.440
Master's approval? When will he approve?

37:49.520 --> 37:52.680
Wait a minute. It's…

37:53.920 --> 37:56.840
No way. You're being greedy on both sides.

37:56.920 --> 37:58.000
You're selling goods
under the trading convoy name

37:58.080 --> 37:59.080
while stealing from the trading convoy

37:59.160 --> 38:01.520
to sell your own goods to your clients.

38:02.920 --> 38:04.240
I'd like to know
how she explains about this.

38:08.600 --> 38:11.760
The mica on the hairpin
is scrap that I bought.

38:12.280 --> 38:13.440
The wood on the hairpin

38:13.520 --> 38:15.280
is old ship wood
that was abandoned on the ship.

38:17.280 --> 38:18.200
Why do you say it's stolen?

38:18.280 --> 38:20.440
Even if these were yours,

38:20.520 --> 38:22.240
you sold them
under the name of the trading convoy.

38:22.320 --> 38:24.560
Thirty percent of the sales
of these things

38:24.640 --> 38:26.720
have been agreed upon to be divided
amongst the trading convoy.

38:26.800 --> 38:27.680
It is very clear.

38:27.760 --> 38:28.920
-I--
-Stop.

38:29.520 --> 38:31.200
It's no one else's fault
if you can't sell.

38:31.280 --> 38:34.040
At Yan's Trading Convoy,
whoever can sell is the boss.

38:35.600 --> 38:36.920
Overseer Cao,

38:37.000 --> 38:38.720
if you like this pin, tell me.

38:39.320 --> 38:41.640
I'll make one in your size, okay?

38:47.480 --> 38:50.400
Don't forget
to let me into the trading convoy.

39:03.880 --> 39:06.480
It's really difficult
to invite Master Yan.

39:07.680 --> 39:09.040
Special Envoy Xu sent out the invitation,

39:09.120 --> 39:10.120
so how dare I disobey?

39:10.200 --> 39:14.400
Master Yan, you've been
so successful and popular

39:14.480 --> 39:15.960
in Guangzhou these days,

39:16.040 --> 39:19.200
while I've been having

39:19.280 --> 39:20.600
a hard time.

39:21.840 --> 39:23.040
You are flattering me.

39:23.120 --> 39:25.680
Haven't you already instructed Mr. Pan?

39:26.360 --> 39:29.280
However, business is business.

39:29.800 --> 39:31.680
Since we placed the order
and signed the contract,

39:31.760 --> 39:33.240
we have to act according to the contract.

39:33.840 --> 39:36.600
Special Envoy Xu. Are you keeping an eye
on the jewelry shop

39:36.680 --> 39:40.240
in Guangzhou for the officials
to mess up your own business?

39:46.840 --> 39:51.200
The business of jewelry in Guangzhou
belongs to jewelry shop owners

39:51.720 --> 39:52.960
instead of me.

39:53.720 --> 39:55.040
That was my mistake.

39:56.000 --> 39:58.440
But Master Yan, are your recent moves

39:59.200 --> 40:01.440
for monopolizing the Guangzhou market,

40:02.720 --> 40:04.000
suppressing Lingnan pearls

40:04.520 --> 40:06.160
with Western Regions colored stone,

40:06.680 --> 40:08.240
and messing up the local jewelry business?

40:08.840 --> 40:10.280
Even if there is no
Western Regions colored stone,

40:10.360 --> 40:12.520
Hepu pearls cannot be handed over.

40:13.120 --> 40:14.440
When you talk about others,

40:14.520 --> 40:16.520
you'd better see if you've taken care
of your own business first.

40:17.600 --> 40:19.480
We are here for a drink.

40:19.560 --> 40:22.040
We don't have to talk business now.

40:22.120 --> 40:23.240
Come on.

40:30.160 --> 40:32.200
Master Yan has come a long way,

40:32.280 --> 40:34.920
so I must not let you go home
empty-handed.

40:35.000 --> 40:38.280
For this, I'm well aware,

40:39.240 --> 40:42.480
but Hepu Pearl is a local industry,

40:42.560 --> 40:44.640
and you want a piece of it.

40:44.720 --> 40:47.920
You're too ambitious.

40:49.240 --> 40:51.800
This is my only shortcoming.
Businessmen are driven by profit,

40:51.880 --> 40:53.280
but yes,

40:53.880 --> 40:57.440
I want Western Regions colored stone
and pearls.

40:58.080 --> 40:59.920
Western Regions colored stone

41:01.040 --> 41:02.080
and pearls?

41:03.440 --> 41:06.520
Fortunately, my words carry weight

41:06.600 --> 41:09.040
in Guangzhou's jewelry industry.

41:10.240 --> 41:11.640
So, you mean…

41:12.800 --> 41:15.720
Three days from now
is the South Sea God Festival.

41:15.800 --> 41:17.120
According to local customs,

41:17.200 --> 41:19.200
we have to place a high-priced treasure
at the bottom of the lake,

41:19.280 --> 41:22.800
and then it's Shark Hunting.

41:24.080 --> 41:25.080
What is Shark Hunting?

41:25.160 --> 41:28.040
Each party can send their skilled men
to pretend to be sharks

41:29.000 --> 41:30.520
and go into the water
to capture the treasure.

41:30.600 --> 41:32.280
The winner is the one
who gets the treasure

41:32.360 --> 41:33.960
within half an incense stick's time.

41:34.480 --> 41:35.440
I know

41:35.520 --> 41:39.520
that both of you want full rights

41:39.600 --> 41:42.000
to the purchase of Hepu Pearls,

41:42.080 --> 41:44.240
so let's use Shark Hunting

41:44.320 --> 41:49.600
to determine who's qualified. Okay?

41:53.120 --> 41:53.960
No problem.

41:54.760 --> 41:56.880
I just love
taking someone else's treasure.

42:06.120 --> 42:08.120
I've paved the way for you.

42:08.680 --> 42:12.520
The rest is up to you.

42:14.360 --> 42:15.760
Don't worry.

42:18.000 --> 42:20.760
On that day, the bottom of the lake
will be covered with sharp blades.

42:21.360 --> 42:24.760
Participants are responsible
for their own lives.

42:24.840 --> 42:27.240
At Shark Hunting,
Cui's Pearl Farm will win.

42:28.000 --> 42:29.520
Anyone who tries to go

42:29.600 --> 42:31.480
against us will disappear.

42:31.560 --> 42:34.600
Xu Nanying wants to help Cui's Pearl Farm
buy tribute pearls

42:35.200 --> 42:37.760
and use Shark Hunting to force me out,

42:39.800 --> 42:41.240
but how can I let him do that?

42:41.320 --> 42:43.200
Our trading convoy is full of northerners.

42:43.280 --> 42:45.600
They're not good swimmers,
so they don't stand a chance

42:46.240 --> 42:48.000
in the water.

42:54.800 --> 42:57.280
In this South Sea God Festival,

42:57.360 --> 43:01.680
Master Yan intends
to select slaves for Shark Hunting.

43:01.760 --> 43:04.200
If you can capture the treasure,

43:04.280 --> 43:07.240
you will regain your freedom

43:08.640 --> 43:12.600
and can take this one million mace
to live a good life.

43:12.680 --> 43:14.520
That much money?

43:15.080 --> 43:16.040
Don't talk.
